    "text": "Sometimes the most loving thing we can do for ourselves is honour what no longer feels safe.⁠\n It’s not about holding grudges, it’s about holding boundaries.⁠\nLet this be a reminder:⁠\nYou don’t have to shrink to keep the peace.⁠\n⁠\n⁠\nYou don’t have to stay where you are constantly explaining your worth.⁠\n⁠\n⁠\nYou don’t have to apologise for protecting your peace. 🌻⁠\n⁠\n⁠\nThis season is asking you to choose truth over tolerance.⁠\n Let go of what dishonours you.⁠\n Make room for what respects you.⁠\nYou deserve that kind of love, starting with your own.⁠",
